Maintainer: Christoph Dalitz <christoph.dalitz@hs-niederrhein.de>
Description: TriplClust assigns each point in a 3D or 2D point cloud a cluster label representing curves or noise. It can be used to detect curves in point clouds. The algorithm is explained in Dalitz et al. (2019) <doi:10.5201/ipol.2019.234>.
